000100*================================================================
000200* PRMCOMM  COMMAREA OF CICS PROGRAM PRMCALC0 (256 BYTES)
000300*
000400* policy-admin MainframePremiumAdapter BUILDS THIS AREA AND CALLS
000500* PRMCALC0 THROUGH CICS TRANSACTION GATEWAY SERVER CORVCTG1 WHEN
000600* FLAG policy.premium-engine = mainframe (PROD ONLY).
000700* ALL NUMBERS ARE UNSIGNED ZONED DECIMAL SO THE JAVA SIDE CAN MAP
000800* THEM AS TEXT. RSP-RETURN-CODE: 00 OK, 08 REFER, 12 BAD REQUEST,
000900* 90 NO RATING PROGRAM FOR THE LINE.
001000*================================================================
001100 01  PRMCOMM-AREA.
001200     05  PRMCOMM-VERSION         PIC X(02).
001300     05  PRMCOMM-REQUEST.
001400         10  REQ-QUOTE-ID        PIC X(20).
001500         10  REQ-LINE-CODE       PIC X(03).
001600         10  REQ-REGION          PIC X(02).
001700         10  REQ-CURRENCY        PIC X(03).
001800         10  REQ-EFFECTIVE-DATE  PIC 9(08).
001900         10  REQ-SUM-INSURED     PIC 9(11)V99.
002000         10  REQ-VOLUNTARY-XS    PIC 9(05).
002100         10  REQ-RISK-SCORE      PIC 9(03).
002200         10  REQ-POSTCODE        PIC X(10).
002300         10  REQ-INSURED-DOB     PIC 9(08).
002400         10  REQ-RISK-DETAIL     PIC X(60).
002500     05  PRMCOMM-RESPONSE.
002600         10  RSP-BASE-PREMIUM    PIC 9(09)V99.
002700         10  RSP-LOADINGS        PIC 9(07)V99.
002800         10  RSP-DISCOUNTS       PIC 9(07)V99.
002900         10  RSP-EXCESS-TOTAL    PIC 9(05).
003000         10  RSP-IPT-AMT         PIC 9(07)V99.
003100         10  RSP-TOTAL-PREMIUM   PIC 9(09)V99.
003200         10  RSP-REFER-FLAG      PIC X(01).
003300         10  RSP-RETURN-CODE     PIC 9(02).
003400         10  RSP-MESSAGE         PIC X(40).
003500     05  FILLER                  PIC X(02).
